#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_edit.rst:5
msgid "Edit element"
msgstr "编辑元件"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_edit.rst:7
msgid "To edit an `element`_:"
msgstr "要编辑 `元件 <element_>`_ ："

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_edit.rst:9
msgid "`Display element properties`_ at `selection properties panel`_."
msgstr ""
"在 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 中 `显示元件属性 <Display element "
"properties_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_edit.rst:10
msgid ""
"Go to `general properties`_ tab and click on the button **Edit element** to "
"display `element editor`_."
msgstr ""
"转到 `常规属性 <general properties_>`_ 标签页，单击 **编辑元件** 按钮以打开 `元件编辑器 <element "
"editor_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_edit.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech general element properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件常规属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_edit.rst:19
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > display > Selection properties**."
msgstr ""
"如果 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 未显示，可通过 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** "
"将其显示出来。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/element_edit.rst:24
msgid ""
"For more information about how to edit elements, refer to `element editor`_ "
"section."
msgstr "有关如何编辑元件的更多信息，请参见 `元件编辑器 <element editor_>`_ 一节。"
